T*
(- **Changelog**: Update `CHANGELOG.md` with user-facing changes since last release.) Tj
T*
(- **Commit Hygiene**: Ensure all changes are committed and PRs reviewed. Optionally sign) Tj
T*
(tags/commits.) Tj
T*
(- **CI Status**: Confirm CI is green \(build, test, lint, security scans\).) Tj
T*
(- **Package Build**: Verify packaging works \(`python -m build`\) and artifacts install \(`pip) Tj
T*
(install dist/*.whl`\).) Tj
T*
(- **Security Scan**: Re-run `pip-audit`, `bandit`, and `licensecheck` on the final state.) Tj
T*
(- **Documentation**: Ensure `README.md` is current. Include any license badges or CI status) Tj
T*
(badges.) Tj
T*
(- **Tag & Publish**: Create a Git tag \(e.g. `vX.Y.Z`\). On push, GitHub Actions should) Tj
T*
(trigger publishing.) Tj
T*
(- **Post-Release**: Update docs site \(if any\) and announce the release.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```mermaid) Tj
T*
(flowchart LR) Tj
T*
(    A[Developer Commits Code] --> B[CI: Lint & Static Analysis]) Tj
T*
(    B --> C[CI: Run Tests \(unit/integration\)]) Tj
T*
(    C --> D[CI: Security Scan \(pip-audit, bandit, trufflehog\)]) Tj
