(    D --> E[CI: License Check \(licensecheck\)]) Tj
T*
(    E --> F[CI: Build Package]) Tj
T*
(    F --> G[Tag Release \(Manual/CI trigger\)]) Tj
T*
(    G --> H[CI: Publish to PyPI/GitHub Packages]) Tj
T*
(    G --> I[GitHub Release notes & Changelog]) Tj
